{
  "sourceStoryId": "0fefa442-e76d-42a5-84b7-05f7e15d9e65",
  "turns": [
    {
      "speaker": "granny",
      "to": [
        "gouer"
      ],
      "mode": "normal",
      "text": "光坐着叹气，冬衣能从墙缝里掉出来？得寻条门路，哪怕舍回老脸。",
      "knowledgeRefs": [],
      "factRefs": [
        "winter_need"
      ],
      "at": 1,
      "until": 8,
      "id": "b1:0",
      "respondsTo": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "gouer",
      "to": [
        "granny"
      ],
      "mode": "normal",
      "text": "王家那门亲早疏了。倒是我爹与周瑞办过事，去问周瑞，许有条路。",
      "knowledgeRefs": [
        "b1:0"
      ],
      "factRefs": [
        "gouer_zhou_connection",
        "wang_old_kinship"
      ],
      "at": 9,
      "until": 16,
      "id": "b1:1",
      "respondsTo": [
        "b1:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "liushi",
      "to": [
        "granny",
        "gouer"
      ],
      "mode": "normal",
      "text": "上门容易，门上人先给冷脸，娘受得住么？",
      "knowledgeRefs": [
        "b1:1"
      ],
      "factRefs": [
        "winter_need",
        "family_roles"
      ],
      "at": 17,
      "until": 22,
      "id": "b1:2",
      "respondsTo": [
        "b1:1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "granny",
      "to": [
        "gouer"
      ],
      "mode": "normal",
      "text": "周瑞我听说过，多年不走动，得有人递话。",
      "knowledgeRefs": [
        "b1:1"
      ],
      "factRefs": [
        "granny_zhou_awareness"
      ],
      "at": 1,
      "until": 6,
      "id": "b2:0",
      "respondsTo": [
        "b1:1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "gouer",
      "to": [
        "granny"
      ],
      "mode": "normal",
      "text": "找我爹旧交周瑞，托他递话，求个临时周济先把冬事支应过去。",
      "knowledgeRefs": [
        "b2:0"
      ],
      "factRefs": [
        "gouer_zhou_connection",
        "winter_need"
      ],
      "at": 7,
      "until": 14,
      "id": "b2:1",
      "respondsTo": [
        "b2:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "liushi",
      "to": [
        "granny"
      ],
      "mode": "normal",
      "text": "娘，我陪你进城，孩子让狗儿看一天。",
      "knowledgeRefs": [
        "b2:1"
      ],
      "factRefs": [
        "family_roles",
        "winter_need"
      ],
      "at": 1,
      "until": 6,
      "id": "b3:0",
      "respondsTo": [
        "b2:1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "granny",
      "to": [
        "liushi",
        "gouer"
      ],
      "mode": "normal",
      "text": "你别去，两个孩子离不得娘。狗儿送我到城门口，我进城寻周瑞递话。",
      "knowledgeRefs": [
        "b3:0",
        "b2:1"
      ],
      "factRefs": [
        "family_roles",
        "granny_zhou_awareness"
      ],
      "at": 7,
